    <data name="PricingNote" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>We set a price for each currency, so it doesn't move with exchange rates. The VAT shown is your country's standard rate. If your business has a VAT number in an EU country other than Austria, you pay no VAT to us: the reverse charge applies.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="GuaranteeSealDays" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>day money-back guarantee</value>
    </data>
    <data name="GuaranteeTitle" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>30 days to change your mind</value>
    </data>
    <data name="GuaranteeBody" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>If Sumwise isn't right for you, write to us within 30 days of your first payment and we refund it in full.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Guarantee1" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>No form to fill in, and no questions about why.</value>
    </data>
